/E (SkyCast is a weather prediction web application built using HTML5, CSS3, and JavaScript that works completely offline without any server, API, or framework. The project is created as a single .html file that opens directly in any browser including VS Code.The app allows users to search weather information for  cities around the world and displays current weather details like temperature, humidity, wind speed, and pressure. It also shows a 7-day weather forecast with actual day names like Monday and Tuesday, correct weather symbols like sun for sunny, cloud for cloudy, and rain for rainy days, along with temperature ranges and rainfall amounts.)
